{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119867","id":3768125791,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7gmQlf","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119867","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119867.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119867.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119867","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119867/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119867/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119867/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0a6fd6ce441b0bfaaaf01b282a667567eee1340f","number":119867,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement tighter directional shadowmap draw rect (GPU-side performance optimization)","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nImproves GPU-side performance of directional shadowmap rendering with no quality loss/user work of any kind.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nThis PR improves directional shadowmap performance by restricting the draw area of the shadowmaps to the bounding box of the frustum:\r\n\r\n4.5-stable:\r\n<img width=\"552\" height=\"552\" alt=\"shadowmaps-4 5-stable\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ea1cd56-1891-4af0-bb87-6fae5ea27061\" />\r\n\r\nPR:\r\n<img width=\"552\" height=\"552\" alt=\"shadowmaps-pr\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2eb4926-7365-46a8-bb05-4141ef7b97e5\" />\r\n\r\nThe bounding box is dynamically adjusted every frame to ensure the tightest fit possible:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52f37195-c1e1-4871-a85c-dac83ec80dd3\r\n\r\nThough in some ways similar to tighter culling, restricting the draw area is actually complementary to it, as it improves performance of what culling can't deal with on its own, primarily large/complex meshes that *do* overlap the frustum, but are overlapping only by a small amount and so waste GPU time by drawing in parts of the shadowmap that aren't ever used.\r\n\r\nThis improvement was proposed by BastiaanOlij in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6948, but for some reason never implemented.\r\n\r\n### Some Benchmarks\r\n\r\nNo directional shadows baseline: 3.88mspf (258fps)\r\n\r\nBistro forward+ 4k shadows:\r\n- 4.5-stable: 5.62mspf (178fps), delta +1.74mspf\r\n- PR: 5.38mspf (186fps), delta +1.50mspf\r\n\r\nBistro forward+ 8k shadows:\r\n- 4.5-stable: 7.41mspf (135fps), delta +3.53mspf\r\n- PR: 6.41mspf (156fps), delta +2.53mspf\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\n\r\nThis PR depends on #119705 being merged first, as it relies on the refactoring done in that PR.\r\n\r\n## PR Status\r\n- [x] forward+: fully functional\r\n- [x] mobile: fully functional\r\n- [x] compatibility: fully functional\r\n- [x] cleanup\r\n- [x] verify correct behaviour of camera previews across renderers\r\n- [x] verify correct behaviour of import window 3d preview across renderers\r\n- [x] verify correct behaviour of orthogonal cameras\r\n- [x] potential off-by-one texel shadowmap coordinates issue? (checked, there are no visual changes between master and PR)\r\n- [x] rebase","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":